    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Courier Life Simulator</strong> puts you behind the wheel of a realistic delivery experience where logistics meets life simulation. Start your shift at the warehouse, load up your packages, and hit the road as a professional courier. Whether you're navigating tight city streets or planning your delivery route for maximum efficiency, every decision shapes your day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start Your Shift</strong> \u2013 Log into your driver account, check available jobs, and prepare your van for a day of deliveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load &amp; Deliver</strong> \u2013 Choose packages based on location, value, or time constraints. Plan your route and deliver with precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warehouse Workflow</strong> \u2013 Return to the hub to end your shift, drop off the van, and transition back into your personal life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Life</strong> \u2013 Spend your earnings on new cars or invest in property. Buy, upgrade, and sell to climb the social and financial ladder.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic courier job simulation with a focus on routine, responsibility, and freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open delivery system \u2014 choose what, when, and where to deliver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living world with economic opportunities outside your shift \u2014 from property management to car collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of job realism and lifestyle freedom, allowing you to create your own path.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Courier Life Simulator</strong> puts you behind the wheel of a realistic delivery experience where logistics meets life simulation. Start your shift at the warehouse, load up your packages, and hit the road as a professional courier. Whether you're navigating tight city streets or planning your delivery route for maximum efficiency, every decision shapes your day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start Your Shift</strong> \u2013 Log into your driver account, check available jobs, and prepare your van for a day of deliveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load &amp; Deliver</strong> \u2013 Choose packages based on location, value, or time constraints. Plan your route and deliver with precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warehouse Workflow</strong> \u2013 Return to the hub to end your shift, drop off the van, and transition back into your personal life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Life</strong> \u2013 Spend your earnings on new cars or invest in property. Buy, upgrade, and sell to climb the social and financial ladder.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic courier job simulation with a focus on routine, responsibility, and freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open delivery system \u2014 choose what, when, and where to deliver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living world with economic opportunities outside your shift \u2014 from property management to car collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of job realism and lifestyle freedom, allowing you to create your own path.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Connect to your driver account on the warehouse desktop , get on shift and load the packages in the van. Deliver the packages , choosing the packages to deliver based on your own preferences. After the shift ends , leave the van at the warehouse and get your personal car and drive to your home.",
